        },
        {
          "commit": "146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12",
          "git_sha": "3fa8a1a6e25c8e1b6e2c92cc2a731e0ad5abf11b",
          "line_end": 70,
          "line_start": 68,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "tastyeffectco/sandboxd",
          "url": "https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12/ARCHITECTURE.md#L68-L70"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2ddf3a6f61bcdfadb59489d7420b114a474ca3aeed49557f3b9223bbe8f91d93",
        "slc_9a795d59d3793ee8f47ef253d1a0852b4cfe0982f445dc6a1a20a6dd0b337870",
        "slc_d798dec3e57b1a84bf379842b1eb07d44f5c7bea483c67a71252d4497fb87e96"
      ],
      "text": "The system is a single Go control-plane binary that shells out to the Docker CLI (no SDK), fronted by Traefik for preview routing, with SQLite (WAL) as the source of truth and an in-sandbox supervisor called runtimed baked into the base image."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_8cbd2e7199062aab13b507b0bf4591f3c4747abd761fb8f1efbf2bba847c7ed5",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12",
          "git_sha": "3fa8a1a6e25c8e1b6e2c92cc2a731e0ad5abf11b",
          "line_end": 128,
          "line_start": 102,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "tastyeffectco/sandboxd",
          "url": "https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12/ARCHITECTURE.md#L102-L128"
        },
        {
          "commit": "146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12",
          "git_sha": "65e00df648b6f93d5f5c96397d78f1a392321ced",
          "line_end": 100,
          "line_start": 97,
          "path": "AGENTS.md",
          "repository": "tastyeffectco/sandboxd",
          "url": "https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12/AGENTS.md#L97-L100"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_50f6c446799329b10e5b42121b0f0cea518017e4ce229f94ab77a8c3b59ee002",
        "slc_8111bc65ed4f56804485bfa66ecca51429edcd5c8db5aa3c2f78608a9849e8d1"
      ],
      "text": "Agent credentials never enter a sandbox: a control-plane-side auth proxy holds the real keys and injects Authorization/X-Api-Key on the wire, giving the sandbox only a base URL and a dummy key; credential-shaped env vars are scrubbed from agent processes."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_39193b384bd8514484a026e19972e97238779c8b5b22456acf87ff3b40d3c7c5",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "design-choices",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12",
          "git_sha": "3fa8a1a6e25c8e1b6e2c92cc2a731e0ad5abf11b",
          "line_end": 234,
          "line_start": 224,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "tastyeffectco/sandboxd",
          "url": "https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12/ARCHITECTURE.md#L224-L234"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_bcaa90d1a4ea4625cbea6e0c5a15285d95cf9b09afd2a7316b588904b160c933"
      ],
      "text": "Each sandbox exposes exactly one public preview endpoint (the manifest's web.port); HTTP, WebSocket upgrades, and SSE all work on that single port, while multi-port apps are not reachable on a second port (multi-port is roadmap, not current behaviour)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_d23df24be027342632044db5df6a1ad4e1f3468865c2175e324ea82e033ae1a6",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "tools-permissions",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12",
          "git_sha": "3fa8a1a6e25c8e1b6e2c92cc2a731e0ad5abf11b",
          "line_end": 167,
          "line_start": 161,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "tastyeffectco/sandboxd",
          "url": "https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12/ARCHITECTURE.md#L161-L167"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_3184890d4358653ae3abd680f025232fb4a2bdc79618effe57b17823a355784b"
      ],
      "text": "Sandboxes run under hardened runc with all capabilities dropped, no-new-privileges, a read-only rootfs with tmpfs /tmp, a hard memory ceiling, pids limit, and fd ulimits; the threat model is authenticated users running their own code, not hostile multi-tenancy."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_eb1ea4d0c150f30055784d8e55d2a215367413a8720316182b7714ca95760e5f",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "orchestration",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12",
          "git_sha": "3fa8a1a6e25c8e1b6e2c92cc2a731e0ad5abf11b",
          "line_end": 65,
          "line_start": 48,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "tastyeffectco/sandboxd",
          "url": "https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12/ARCHITECTURE.md#L48-L65"
        },
        {
          "commit": "146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12",
          "git_sha": "3fa8a1a6e25c8e1b6e2c92cc2a731e0ad5abf11b",
          "line_end": 157,
          "line_start": 151,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "tastyeffectco/sandboxd",
          "url": "https://github.com/tastyeffectco/sandboxd/blob/146711407bb9b3b0354b87758e3f9132e6616e12/ARCHITECTURE.md#L151-L157"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2ddf3a6f61bcdfadb59489d7420b114a474ca3aeed49557f3b9223bbe8f91d93",
        "slc_eb2b794df89de5c11d3b98f61a5a9152b1c6c87922350804848230c2e5434666"
      ],
      "text": "The control plane runs an idle reaper that stops sandboxes past an idle threshold and a pressure reaper that stops sandboxes when host memory is low; a wake path starts a stopped container on the first preview request and serves a warming page."
    },
    {
